r that the arrest is necessary for one or the more purposes envisaged by sub-clauses (a) to (e)",\u8232 "reason": "It clearly states the police necessity requirement but does not specify what the Magistrate must check before authorising detention.",\u8232 "confidence": "high"\u8232 \},\u8232 \{\u8232 "no": 12,\u8232 "mark": "Yes",\u8232 "evidence": "the Magistrate has to address the question whether specific reasons have been recorded for arrest and if so, prima facie those reasons are relevant",\u8232 "reason": "It directly states that the Magistrate must scrutinise recorded arrest reasons and whether the Section 41 conditions could reasonably be satisfied.",\u8232 "confidence": "high"\u8232 \}\u8232 ],\u8232 "good_answer_present": "Yes",\u8232 "best_passage_no": 1,\u8232 "caveats": ""\u8232 \}\
